{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024210/extras/2f0817a14c595336aa69796f68705f1c.webp?t=1565373597\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>In this sequel to Zeran's Folly, you play as Felix (or Felicia), an adventurer on their first big solo adventure away from home. To find their holy grail they'll have to schmooze friends, thumb wrestle with enemies, and upgrade all their junk.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024210/extras/15d720b7ba1cb50eee89ee310087167a.webp?t=1565373597\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Eight unique weapons</strong> to level up and master that you can switch between instantly anywhere. <strong>There's even a gun</strong><br></li><li><strong>Lots of outfits</strong> to play dress-up with<br></li><li>A dragon's hoard's worth of <strong>magic rings that improve your abilities</strong><br></li><li>Plenty of places to explore and <strong>die</strong> in<br></li><li><strong>Full controller support</strong> with rebinding menu<br></li><li><strong>Cool soundtrack</strong> from jaunty tunes to <strong>abusive metal</strong><br></li><li>German and Swiss German localizations<br></li><li><strong>Cats</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024210/extras/0a27215f1766e429ccb289df8ef3ee2c.webp?t=1565373597\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Weapons level up!</strong> Level up each weapon to increase power and unlock slots for upgrades<br></li><li><strong>New armor rating!</strong> Keep your duds up to snuff or you'll end up face-down in a pool of your own blood<br></li><li>Hordes of <strong>new enemies</strong> to kill<br></li><li>New Destroyer Mode <strong>(hard mode)</strong>. No upgrades allowed. Can you handle it?<br></li><li><strong>Hip Flask rebalance</strong> and new <strong>Mega Potion buffs</strong>. Drink from the Hip Flask to get temporary buffs to attack power, defense, and even slow time<br></li><li><strong>New minigames</strong> like Gel Blast, Blackjack, and Hoverboard Surfing<br></li><li><strong>More save slots</strong> (yay!)<br></li><li><strong>New features</strong> like Smart Camera and Damage Numbers</li></ul><br>Owners of <strong>Zeran's Folly</strong> also get some unique outfits and other cool things: <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024210/extras/3061ba2d6956b92c6a4b95fdf0a5e6ba.avif?t=1565373597\" width=600 height=338 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"False Advertising","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024210/aad9b36b85855cfe37a0e39a875b71763a07ffcd.jpg"},{"name":"Pirates in the Bay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024210/66ab1990718ee79eb8007680c7dab2c401422cb0.jpg"},{"name":"Training Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024210/19c92ae7e74fc0f565bbd858a8ac6f5be1b76994.jpg"},{"name":"Stretch Pants","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024210/7d81cdd4fbbf841bbe57babf857146cb4b1bbbb0.jpg"},{"name":"Owl's Well That Ends Well","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024210/98d9136e66836da739fa80df3fb041a55294087c.jpg"},{"name":"Closing Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024210/35be03cac5bd9c1dfd0d8b18512a484fdaac9401.jpg"},{"name":"Yeah, I'm Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024210/47cff18fc655c93c316433c495f74e31997bfb8c.jpg"},{"name":"Strawberries for Mommy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit